vendor's own application uses without a signed-in user. It sends no
credentials, implements no authentication, and circumvents no access control.

The documentation under docs-apk/ describes those endpoints as observed in the
vendor's publicly distributed Android client, and quotes short excerpts of
decompiled code as evidence for specific factual claims. Those excerpts remain
